  "description": "What happens when people from parallel universes meet? Wimp is a story centered around someone who meets the parallel versions of himself- whether dead or alive. Follow Mek and Meb as they try to fill the shoes of their predecessor, Med, in the world where music is looked down upon. How will the late Med's friends view Mek and Meb? Can they change the world? Do they even want to? The story only gets more interesting from there.\nSource: Tapas",
